OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FToday, mist and fog patches in
OL,6,Fthe south will soon clear, leaving a
OL,7,Fmostly cloudy theme with the odd
OL,8,Fdrizzly shower in the north. Some
OL,9,Fbrighter spells may develop during the
OL,10,Fafternoon. Feeling mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FTonight, further cloud and
OL,13,Frain will spill down from the north,
OL,14,Fwith some heavy bursts in the
OL,15,Fnorthwest. Feeling cooler in the north
OL,16,Fbut staying fairly mild in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
