OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FRain clearing through
OL,6,FWednesday morning to bring sunny
OL,7,Fspells and scattered showers. It will
OL,8,Ffeel markedly cooler with winds
OL,9,Fincreasing, and especially cool around
OL,10,Fcoasts where winds will become strong.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FOn
OL,13,FThursday, sunny spells with showers
OL,14,Feasing, feeling cool in a
OL,15,Fnorthwesterly breeze. Cloud
OL,16,Fthickening, bringing rain and strong
OL,17,Fwinds into Friday. Becoming more
OL,18,Fsettled later on Friday and Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
